                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="p-4 bg-light rounded-4 border text-center h-100 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="h3 mb-2">🎧</div>
                        <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-1" style="font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;">Lifetime Support
                        </h5>
                        <p class="text-secondary small mb-2">Direct assistance for configuration & upgrades.</p>
                        <a href="mailto:hello@incipientcorp.com"
                            class="fw-bold text-success text-decoration-none small">hello@incipientcorp.com</a>
